# title: Grain cloud
# about: Scatters whatever you feed it into a cloud of short grains, wet only. Good on a pad or a mallet.
# feed: cloud_grains.in
# port: cloud_grains.freeze (gate): hold the current buffer while the gate is high.
# port: cloud_grains.l, cloud_grains.r (audio): the cloud, already cabled to out.
part cloud "Grain cloud" colour #d1a233
  module cloud_grains Shavings size=0.4 density=0.6 spray=0.4 pitch=0.5

cable cloud_grains.l -> out.l
cable cloud_grains.r -> out.r
